('127.568.d.7.B',4,'Liability insurance helps a business pay for losses if a guest is:','["greeted", "injured", "entertained", "seated"]'::jsonb,1,'Insurance covers costs when someone is hurt on the property.','original'),
('127.568.d.7.C',3,'A broken lock on a guest room door is a security issue that should be reported and:','["hidden", "decorated", "repaired", "ignored"]'::jsonb,2,'Security problems must be fixed quickly.','original'),
('127.568.d.7.C',4,'Security cameras in lobbies and parking areas help prevent:','["laughter", "tourism", "cooking", "theft"]'::jsonb,3,'Visible cameras discourage crime and help investigate incidents.','original'),
('127.568.d.7.D',3,'A hotel must have a plan for a hurricane, which is a natural:','["disaster", "feature", "holiday", "bonus"]'::jsonb,0,'Hurricanes, floods, and earthquakes are natural disasters.','original'),
('127.568.d.7.D',4,'A smell of smoke on a guest floor should be treated as a possible:','["holiday", "fire", "sale", "promotion"]'::jsonb,1,'Smoke can signal a fire, so staff follow emergency procedures.','original'),
