('127.568.d.8.B',3,'A written approach for greeting, serving, and following up with the people who buy from a business is aimed at satisfying its:','["customers", "inspectors", "rivals", "vendors"]'::jsonb,0,'The plan keeps service consistent for every customer.','original'),
('127.568.d.8.B',4,'Collecting feedback after a stay lets a hotel measure guest:','["weight", "satisfaction", "height", "distance"]'::jsonb,1,'Feedback shows how happy guests were and what to improve.','original'),
('127.568.d.8.C',3,'A staffing guide shows how many employees are needed for each shift and:','["color", "weather", "position", "song"]'::jsonb,2,'The guide matches the right number of workers to each job.','original'),
