('127.568.d.8.E',4,'Trends toward inclusive services aim to welcome guests of all abilities and:','["shoe sizes", "colors", "time zones", "backgrounds"]'::jsonb,3,'Inclusive hospitality welcomes everyone.','original'),
('127.568.d.8.F',3,'A diagram showing who reports to whom in a hotel is an organizational:','["chart", "menu", "receipt", "recipe"]'::jsonb,0,'An organizational chart maps the structure of a business.','original'),
('127.568.d.8.F',4,'Lodging, food and beverage, and recreation are different kinds of hospitality:','["seasons", "operations", "holidays", "uniforms"]'::jsonb,1,'Each operation has its own structure and staff roles.','original'),
