('127.568.d.9.A',4,'Setting quality standards for a dish helps every cook prepare it the:','["cheapest way", "fastest way", "loudest way", "same way"]'::jsonb,3,'Standards create consistent results from every cook.','original'),
('127.568.d.9.B',3,'A balanced plate includes fruits, vegetables, grains, protein, and:','["dairy", "frosting", "candy", "soda"]'::jsonb,0,'MyPlate groups include dairy for calcium and protein.','original'),
('127.568.d.9.B',4,'Planning a menu with whole grains and lean protein supports good:','["lighting", "nutrition", "parking", "gossip"]'::jsonb,1,'Healthy ingredients provide needed nutrients.','original'),
('127.568.d.9.C',3,'Which piece of equipment is best for baking bread?','["steam table", "dish machine", "convection oven", "ice machine"]'::jsonb,2,'Ovens bake bread with dry, circulating heat.','original'),
('127.568.d.9.C',4,'A grill is best suited to which cooking method?','["poaching", "freezing", "fermenting", "dry heat"]'::jsonb,3,'Grilling cooks food with direct dry heat.','original'),
('127.568.d.10.A',3,'At check-in, a front desk agent collects the guest''s name, address, and length of:','["stay", "voice", "hair", "shoe"]'::jsonb,0,'Registration records who is staying and for how long.','original'),
('127.568.d.10.A',4,'Registration records the guest''s payment method and the number of people in the:','["elevator", "party", "lobby", "parking lot"]'::jsonb,1,'The party size helps assign the right room.','original'),
