('127.569.d.1.A',3,'A server who speaks clearly and politely to guests is using effective oral:','["communication", "inventory", "seating", "payroll"]'::jsonb,0,'Clear speech helps guests understand and feel welcome.','original'),
('127.569.d.1.A',4,'A written note to the kitchen about a food allergy must be clear and complete so that no one makes a:','["reservation", "mistake", "menu", "profit"]'::jsonb,1,'Unclear allergy notes can lead to dangerous errors.','original'),
('127.569.d.1.B',3,'Food service workers should tie back long hair and keep fingernails short and clean as part of personal:','["decor", "marketing", "hygiene", "payroll"]'::jsonb,2,'Good hygiene prevents contamination of food.','original'),
('127.569.d.1.B',4,'A clean, pressed uniform and name tag help create a professional:','["budget", "recipe", "menu", "appearance"]'::jsonb,3,'Uniform standards show pride and build guest confidence.','original'),
('127.569.d.1.C',3,'When a cook arrives late, the whole kitchen can fall behind. This shows why employees must be:','["punctual", "decorative", "hungry", "anonymous"]'::jsonb,0,'Being on time keeps the team on schedule.','original'),
('127.569.d.1.C',4,'Making a prep list at the start of a shift is a time-management tool that helps a cook finish tasks by the:','["weekend", "deadline", "holiday", "tip jar"]'::jsonb,1,'Lists help workers plan their time and meet deadlines.','original'),
