('127.569.d.1.G',4,'Volunteering at a local food bank is a way for restaurant students to practice teamwork and:','["gossip", "service", "rivalry", "delay"]'::jsonb,1,'Community service builds skills and helps others.','original'),
('127.569.d.2.A',3,'Filing recipes, invoices, and schedules so they can be found quickly is an example of information:','["decoration", "avoidance", "management", "gossip"]'::jsonb,2,'Organized records save time and prevent errors.','original'),
('127.569.d.2.A',4,'A restaurant manager keeps supplier phone numbers in a digital contact list to organize:','["furniture", "recipes", "uniforms", "information"]'::jsonb,3,'Digital tools help store and retrieve information.','original'),
('127.569.d.2.B',3,'A written list of duties and qualifications for a cook position is a job:','["description", "receipt", "recipe", "penalty"]'::jsonb,0,'A job description tells applicants what the position involves.','original'),
('127.569.d.2.B',4,'A restaurant menu should have clear item names, prices, and accurate:','["music", "descriptions", "parking", "weather"]'::jsonb,1,'Accurate descriptions help guests order with confidence.','original'),
