('127.569.d.3.C',4,'A new-hire training plan should include safety rules, job duties, and a checklist to track:','["weather", "progress", "gossip", "parking"]'::jsonb,1,'A checklist shows what the new hire has mastered.','original'),
('127.569.d.3.D',3,'A server who smiles and makes eye contact while greeting a table is using nonverbal:','["menus", "debts", "cues", "taxes"]'::jsonb,2,'Facial expressions and eye contact send messages without words.','original'),
('127.569.d.3.D',4,'A friendly tone of voice and polite words are verbal cues that make guests feel:','["confused", "ignored", "rushed", "welcome"]'::jsonb,3,'Positive communication makes guests comfortable.','original'),
