('127.569.d.4.A',4,'An employee-of-the-month program is an idea that can raise employee:','["fatigue", "debt", "tardiness", "morale"]'::jsonb,3,'Recognition motivates workers and improves attitude.','original'),
('127.569.d.4.B',3,'Two guests complain about the same slow dish. A manager who finds the cause before deciding how to fix it is using critical:','["thinking", "spending", "hiding", "guessing"]'::jsonb,0,'Critical thinking looks for the root of a problem.','original'),
('127.569.d.4.B',4,'To resolve a conflict between a server and a cook, a manager should listen to both sides and stay:','["angry", "neutral", "absent", "silent"]'::jsonb,1,'Fair listening helps find a solution both can accept.','original'),
('127.569.d.5.A',3,'Many restaurants use software to track inventory, schedules, and sales. These are information technology:','["menus", "recipes", "tools", "uniforms"]'::jsonb,2,'IT tools help manage workplace tasks.','original'),
('127.569.d.5.A',4,'A spreadsheet helps a manager organize and calculate:','["weather", "music", "rumors", "data"]'::jsonb,3,'Spreadsheets store numbers and perform calculations.','original'),
('127.569.d.5.B',3,'An income statement shows a restaurant''s revenue, expenses, and:','["net profit", "table size", "menu items", "guest count"]'::jsonb,0,'The bottom line of an income statement is profit or loss.','original'),
('127.569.d.5.B',4,'A manager who sees that food costs are too high on the income statement can change portion sizes or menu:','["music", "prices", "lighting", "uniforms"]'::jsonb,1,'Adjusting portions or prices helps control food cost.','original'),
