('127.569.d.6.B',4,'A schedule that matches staff to busy and slow periods helps a restaurant avoid long waits and excess:','["sunshine", "music", "parking", "labor costs"]'::jsonb,3,'Right-sizing staff controls payroll while serving guests well.','original'),
