('127.569.d.8.A',4,'Restaurants that serve alcohol must follow state laws about checking each customer''s:','["height", "address", "hobbies", "age"]'::jsonb,3,'Only people of legal age may be served alcohol.','original'),
('127.569.d.8.B',3,'Insurance that pays for claims when a customer is harmed by a restaurant''s actions is called:','["liability insurance", "car insurance", "life insurance", "travel insurance"]'::jsonb,0,'Liability coverage protects the business from financial loss.','original'),
('127.569.d.8.B',4,'A guest slips on a wet floor and sues. Liability insurance can help the restaurant pay legal costs and:','["bonuses", "damages", "rent", "wages"]'::jsonb,1,'Insurance covers court-ordered damages and legal fees.','original'),
('127.569.d.9.A',3,'A manager who assigns prep work to the kitchen crew so she can focus on ordering is using:','["elimination", "hesitation", "delegation", "isolation"]'::jsonb,2,'Delegation means giving tasks to others.','original'),
('127.569.d.9.A',4,'When delegating a task, the manager should explain the job, set a deadline, and give the employee the needed:','["rivals", "punishment", "excuses", "authority"]'::jsonb,3,'Workers need clear instructions and the power to complete the task.','original'),
('127.569.d.9.B',3,'If forecasted sales are low for Tuesday, a manager can cut scheduled hours to reduce payroll:','["costs", "guests", "profits", "sales"]'::jsonb,0,'Fewer hours means lower labor costs.','original'),
('127.569.d.9.B',4,'Payroll costs are the money spent on employee:','["menus", "wages", "taxes", "rent"]'::jsonb,1,'Payroll is the total paid to workers.','original'),
('127.569.d.9.C',3,'At opening, which task has the highest priority for food safety?','["updating the menu cover", "rearranging chairs", "checking cooler temperatures", "polishing the sign"]'::jsonb,2,'Unsafe temperatures can make food unsafe, so safety checks come first.','original'),
('127.569.d.9.C',4,'Doing tasks that must be finished before the lunch rush first is called ranking tasks by:','["color", "alphabet", "height", "urgency"]'::jsonb,3,'Urgent tasks need to be done first.','original'),
('127.569.d.10.A',3,'Networking, checking job boards, and contacting employers directly are strategies for seeking:','["employment", "reservations", "vacations", "discounts"]'::jsonb,0,'Active searching leads to more job opportunities.','original'),
('127.569.d.10.A',4,'Telling people in the industry that you are job hunting is part of:','["inventory", "networking", "gossiping", "budgeting"]'::jsonb,1,'Many jobs are found through personal contacts.','original'),
('127.569.d.10.B',3,'Many restaurant managers start as line cooks or servers and add culinary or hospitality:','["holidays", "vacations", "education", "rivalry"]'::jsonb,2,'Education plus experience leads to management roles.','original'),
('127.569.d.10.B',4,'A culinary school diploma or a food manager certification is part of the training that can lead to a restaurant:','["penalty", "lawsuit", "holiday", "career"]'::jsonb,3,'Training and credentials open career paths.','original'),
('127.569.d.10.C',3,'When choosing items for a career portfolio, include education and work history highlights that match the job you want and leave out:','["irrelevant details", "your skills", "your name", "your certificates"]'::jsonb,0,'A portfolio should be focused on what supports your goal.','original'),
