('127.571.d.3.C',4,'Convention centers, hotels, and associations hire people for meeting and event:','["penalties", "landscapes", "rumors", "positions"]'::jsonb,3,'The industry offers many job opportunities.','original'),
('127.571.d.4.A',3,'Early event planning was often done by hotel staff or family members, but today it is a specialized:','["profession", "penalty", "season", "hobby"]'::jsonb,0,'The industry has grown into a recognized career field.','original'),
('127.571.d.4.A',4,'Technology such as online registration and event apps has changed how planners manage:','["fonts", "attendees", "ink", "weather"]'::jsonb,1,'Digital tools streamline registration and communication.','original'),
('127.571.d.4.B',3,'Hybrid events that combine in-person and online attendance are a current industry:','["rumor", "penalty", "trend", "error"]'::jsonb,2,'Hybrid formats have grown in popularity.','original'),
('127.571.d.4.B',4,'Many planners now focus on sustainability by reducing waste and using reusable:','["rumors", "penalties", "rivals", "materials"]'::jsonb,3,'Eco-friendly practices are a growing trend.','original'),
('127.571.d.4.C',3,'A person who negotiates room blocks and contracts for large conferences is often a:','["convention services manager", "pilot", "dentist", "lifeguard"]'::jsonb,0,'Convention services managers coordinate venue services for large events.','original'),
('127.571.d.4.C',4,'A professional who plans corporate meetings, incentive trips, and conferences is a:','["tour pilot", "corporate meeting planner", "wedding photographer", "pastry chef"]'::jsonb,1,'Corporate planners organize business events.','original'),
('127.571.d.4.D',3,'An experienced planner who gives advice and guidance to a newcomer is a:','["rival", "vendor", "mentor", "client"]'::jsonb,2,'A mentor shares knowledge and supports career growth.','original'),
('127.571.d.4.D',4,'A good place to meet a possible mentor is at an industry association:','["lawsuit", "audit", "penalty", "meeting"]'::jsonb,3,'Association gatherings connect newcomers with veterans.','original'),
('127.571.d.4.E',3,'A career plan to become a director of events would list the education, experience, and:','["certifications", "costumes", "vacations", "rumors"]'::jsonb,0,'Credentials help show readiness for advancement.','original'),
('127.571.d.4.E',4,'Setting a date to earn a degree and a date to apply for a promotion are steps in a:','["seating plan", "career plan", "floor map", "food menu"]'::jsonb,1,'A career plan maps goals and timelines.','original'),
('127.571.d.5.A',3,'A corporate client wants a formal luncheon while a family wants a casual picnic. Planners must meet the varying needs of their:','["vendors", "rivals", "customers", "landlords"]'::jsonb,2,'Each customer has different goals and expectations.','original'),
('127.571.d.5.A',4,'Asking each client about their goals, budget, and guest list helps a planner tailor the event to their:','["rivals", "pets", "debts", "needs"]'::jsonb,3,'Understanding needs leads to a successful event.','original'),
('127.571.d.5.B',3,'If more clients start requesting virtual events, a planning company may modify its business plan to add:','["online services", "taxi service", "ice carving only", "lawn mowing"]'::jsonb,0,'Business plans change as customer demand changes.','original'),
('127.571.d.5.B',4,'Reviewing a business plan each year lets a company adjust to changes in the:','["calendar", "market", "uniform", "weather"]'::jsonb,1,'Regular review keeps the plan relevant.','original'),
('127.571.d.5.C',3,'A planner serving a group with different religious dietary practices should offer menu options that respect these:','["routes", "colors", "customs", "prices"]'::jsonb,2,'Respecting customs shows cultural awareness.','original'),
('127.571.d.5.C',4,'Learning how greetings and dress codes vary across cultures helps planners avoid offending:','["insurers", "lawyers", "vendors", "guests"]'::jsonb,3,'Cultural knowledge prevents misunderstandings.','original'),
('127.571.d.6.A',3,'Software that tracks registrations, budgets, and tasks in one place is an event planning:','["platform", "contract", "recipe", "costume"]'::jsonb,0,'Planning platforms centralize event management.','original'),
('127.571.d.6.A',4,'Before purchasing software, a planner should compare features, price, and ease of:','["rent", "use", "sale", "loss"]'::jsonb,1,'Easy-to-use tools save time.','original'),
('127.571.d.6.B',3,'A planner creates a video and slide show for a client pitch. This is a multimedia:','["receipt", "menu", "presentation", "invoice"]'::jsonb,2,'Multimedia presentations combine several media types.','original'),
('127.571.d.6.B',4,'A publication that combines text, graphics, video, and sound is called:','["handwritten", "monochrome", "silent", "multimedia"]'::jsonb,3,'Multimedia uses more than one form of content.','original'),
('127.571.d.6.C',3,'At a conference bookstore table, a point-of-sale system records each sale and calculates:','["totals", "routes", "moods", "weather"]'::jsonb,0,'POS systems total purchases and track payments.','original'),
('127.571.d.6.C',4,'POS data from a past conference can show which items sold best and help plan the next:','["lawsuit", "event", "lease", "holiday"]'::jsonb,1,'Sales data guides future planning.','original'),
('127.571.d.6.D',3,'An event website with an agenda and sign-up form helps promote an event and increases:','["fines", "rainfall", "registrations", "errors"]'::jsonb,2,'Online promotion and sign-up forms attract participants.','original'),
('127.571.d.6.D',4,'Social media and email newsletters are Internet resources that help planners reach a wider:','["venue", "budget", "calendar", "audience"]'::jsonb,3,'Online tools extend a planner''s reach.','original'),
('127.571.d.6.E',3,'Event apps that let attendees view schedules and message speakers improve the guest:','["experience", "deposit", "invoice", "penalty"]'::jsonb,0,'Apps make events more convenient and interactive.','original'),
('127.571.d.6.E',4,'Name badges with QR codes speed up check-in and reduce long:','["speeches", "lines", "menus", "budgets"]'::jsonb,1,'Fast scanning moves guests through entry quickly.','original'),
('127.571.d.6.F',3,'Sending a digital proposal and collecting an electronic signature are examples of using electronic tools to sell an event to a:','["vendor", "rival", "client", "regulator"]'::jsonb,2,'Electronic tools make selling faster and easier.','original'),
('127.571.d.6.F',4,'Email, text messages, and chat apps are electronic tools for planning and sharing event:','["rumors", "fines", "weather", "updates"]'::jsonb,3,'Quick messages keep teams and guests informed.','original'),
('127.571.d.7.A',3,'A planner who never shares a client''s guest list or contract details with outsiders is protecting:','["confidentiality", "competition", "discounts", "publicity"]'::jsonb,0,'Keeping client information private is a core ethical duty.','original'),
('127.571.d.7.A',4,'Using a client''s private information to get a better deal for yourself would be:','["required", "unethical", "generous", "traditional"]'::jsonb,1,'Misusing private information breaks trust and ethics.','original'),
('127.571.d.7.B',3,'A contract''s cancellation clause explains what happens if the client:','["eats", "tips", "cancels", "arrives"]'::jsonb,2,'The clause sets fees or refunds for cancellations.','original'),
('127.571.d.7.B',4,'Besides dates and services, an event contract usually lists the total price and the payment:','["costume", "rumor", "slogan", "schedule"]'::jsonb,3,'Payment schedules say when money is due.','original'),
('127.571.d.7.C',3,'A permit from the city may be required to hold a large outdoor:','["event", "rumor", "loan", "lawsuit"]'::jsonb,0,'Local rules often require permits for public gatherings.','original'),
('127.571.d.7.C',4,'Laws that require access for people with disabilities, such as ramps, must be considered when selecting a:','["font", "venue", "song", "color"]'::jsonb,1,'Venues must be accessible under the ADA.','original'),
('127.571.d.7.D',3,'Checking badges at entrances and hiring guards are examples of event:','["catering", "decor", "security", "marketing"]'::jsonb,2,'Security measures control who enters and keep people safe.','original'),
('127.571.d.7.D',4,'Large events with public figures or valuables on display have a greater need for security to protect people and:','["fonts", "rumors", "menus", "property"]'::jsonb,3,'Security protects both attendees and belongings.','original'),
('127.571.d.7.E',3,'Before buying insurance, a planner should compare coverage limits, deductibles, and:','["premiums", "nicknames", "colors", "fonts"]'::jsonb,0,'Premiums are the amounts paid for coverage.','original'),
('127.571.d.7.E',4,'Two quotes for event insurance should be compared on what each policy covers and what it:','["seats", "excludes", "serves", "decorates"]'::jsonb,1,'Exclusions list what is not covered.','original'),
('127.571.d.7.F',3,'If a storm forces an outdoor wedding to be canceled, event cancellation insurance can reimburse the:','["music", "menu", "financial losses", "guest list"]'::jsonb,2,'Insurance helps recover money spent when events are canceled.','original'),
('127.571.d.7.F',4,'Liability coverage at an event protects the host if a guest is hurt or if property is:','["invited", "catered", "framed", "damaged"]'::jsonb,3,'Liability insurance pays for injury and damage claims.','original'),
('127.571.d.8.A',3,'An employer''s responsibilities include training workers and providing safety equipment, while a worker''s include following safety:','["rules", "rumors", "trends", "fashions"]'::jsonb,0,'Both employers and workers share safety duties.','original'),
('127.571.d.8.A',4,'If a worker sees a hazard at an event site, the right action is to:','["ignore it", "report it", "hide it", "photograph it only"]'::jsonb,1,'Reporting lets the hazard be fixed before someone is hurt.','original'),
('127.571.d.8.B',3,'Employers can be fined by OSHA if they fail to correct serious safety:','["vacations", "menus", "violations", "recipes"]'::jsonb,2,'OSHA can cite and penalize employers for violations.','original'),
('127.571.d.8.B',4,'OSHA''s workplace rules apply to event setup crews who work with ladders, rigging, and:','["name tags", "confetti", "gift bags", "heavy equipment"]'::jsonb,3,'Setup work often involves hazardous equipment.','original'),
('127.571.d.8.C',3,'Measuring noise levels at a loud venue to protect workers'' hearing is part of industrial:','["hygiene", "marketing", "decoration", "registration"]'::jsonb,0,'Industrial hygiene measures and controls workplace exposures.','original'),
('127.571.d.8.C',4,'Providing earplugs for workers near loud speakers is one way to control exposure to harmful:','["colors", "noise", "weather", "smiles"]'::jsonb,1,'Hearing protection reduces noise exposure.','original'),
('127.571.d.8.D',3,'A buffet left out for hours at room temperature can grow harmful:','["flavors", "vitamins", "bacteria", "colors"]'::jsonb,2,'Food in the danger zone allows bacteria to multiply.','original'),
('127.571.d.8.D',4,'Event caterers keep hot foods hot and cold foods cold to prevent food-borne:','["trends", "menus", "profits", "illness"]'::jsonb,3,'Temperature control stops pathogens from growing.','original'),
('127.571.d.8.E',3,'Hard hats and safety glasses worn by an event setup crew are types of personal protective:','["equipment", "itineraries", "agreements", "entertainment"]'::jsonb,0,'PPE shields workers from head and eye injuries.','original'),
('127.571.d.8.E',4,'Gloves, goggles, and masks should be chosen based on the specific hazard a worker faces, which is why PPE must be:','["optional", "properly selected", "very colorful", "hidden"]'::jsonb,1,'The right protection depends on the hazard.','original'),
('127.571.d.8.F',3,'Tape or ramps used to cover cables across a ballroom floor help prevent:','["dancing", "singing", "tripping", "laughing"]'::jsonb,2,'Covering cords removes a trip hazard.','original'),
('127.571.d.8.F',4,'Ladders used to hang banners should be placed on a firm, level:','["menu", "guest list", "budget", "surface"]'::jsonb,3,'A stable base keeps a ladder from tipping.','original'),
('127.571.d.8.G',3,'Overloading a power strip with too many lights and sound devices can cause a circuit to:','["overheat", "expire", "freeze", "sing"]'::jsonb,0,'Too much load can overheat wiring and start a fire.','original'),
('127.571.d.8.G',4,'Outdoor events need electrical equipment rated for use in wet:','["budgets", "conditions", "menus", "fashions"]'::jsonb,1,'Rain increases shock risk, so equipment must be rated for it.','original')
) as v(code, diff, prompt, choices, ans, expl, src)
